<% content_for :title, "Terms — #{app_name}" %>
<% content_for :unframed, "true" %>

<div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-12">
  <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl">Terms</h1>
  <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#3d3832]">
    <p><%= app_name %> sends WhatsApp template messages that Meta has approved. A business may send them only to people who opted in to hear from that business.</p>
    <p>The product does not provide a support inbox or a box for free-form replies. Inbound messages are kept so the desk can record STOP and START.</p>
    <p>A marketing template must tell people how to opt out. A person who sends STOP, or stop all, unsubscribe, cancel, end, quit, or opt out, is not sent further marketing until they send START.</p>
    <p>Use of WhatsApp must follow the WhatsApp Business policy. A desk that breaches Meta's policies can be suspended. Questions about these terms go to <%= app_support_email %>.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-8 text-sm"><%= link_to "Home", root_path %> · <%= link_to "Privacy", privacy_path %></p>
</div>
